@startuml
title D-02 Operational Visibility vs Financial Truth Boundary
left to right direction

rectangle "Operational Visibility\nmay use projection/health data" as Ops {
  rectangle "Active sessions"
  rectangle "Occupancy approximation"
  rectangle "Entry age / long stay"
  rectangle "Connector health"
  rectangle "Last poll / freshness"
  rectangle "Degraded state"
}

rectangle "Financial Truth\nmust use canonical records" as Fin {
  rectangle "TariffSnapshot"
  rectangle "PaymentAttempt"
  rectangle "PaymentConfirmation"
  rectangle "ProviderOutcome"
  rectangle "POS fiscal documents"
  rectangle "Reconciliation records"
}

rectangle "Management Dashboard\nand Reporting" as MDR

Ops --> MDR : displayed with\nfreshness/stale labels
Fin --> MDR : displayed as\ncanonical financial/fiscal data

MDR -[hidden]-> Ops
MDR -[hidden]-> Fin

note bottom of Ops
Projection and occupancy approximation
are operational visibility only.
They are not payment, fiscal, settlement,
exit, discount, or revenue truth.
end note

note bottom of Fin
Financial and revenue dashboards
must reconcile to canonical payment,
fiscal, and reconciliation sources.
end note
@enduml
